<title>UK: Freighter carrying rice grounded at Novorossisk.</title>
<headline>Freighter carrying rice grounded at Novorossisk.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Romanian-flagged freighter Arad was grounded at Novorossisk outer roads on April 11 following engine problems while manoeuvring in storm conditions, Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>The 15,940 dwt vessel was carrying a cargo of 12,970 tonnes of bagged rice. Water ingress was reported and salvage operations are under discussion.</p>
</text>
